From 1c63457620fdab2b1683cb0ebe01096116fe2c61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 00:11:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Route compact MarkDuplicates replay through ordinal decisions

The small-input compact plan now serializes duplicate, optical, and
DS/DI decisions into the same ordinal stream used by the external
two-pass engine, then replays the input BAM through the shared
write_external_plan_records path. Plan records are dropped before
replay, so the second pass no longer depends on an in-memory record
vector.
---
 crates/turbo-picard-markdup/src/lib.rs | 135 +++++++++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 82 insertions(+), 53 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/turbo-picard-markdup/src/lib.rs b/crates/turbo-picard-markdup/src/lib.rs
