 ) -> Result<Option<(u64, ExternalDecision)>, std::io::Error> {
     let mut ordinal_bytes = [0_u8; 8];
     if reader.read(&mut ordinal_bytes[..1])? == 0 {
@@ -1627,7 +1627,7 @@ fn read_external_duplicate_decision(
 
